    oe:answerText "We conducted a systematic review and meta-analysis to quantify the effect of attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) medication on quality of life (QoL), and to understand whether this effect differs between stimulants and nonstimulants. From the dataset of a published network meta-analysis (Cortese et al., 2018 We included 17 RCTs (5,388 participants in total; 56% randomized to active medication) in the meta-analyses."^^xsd:string ;
